# Concepts and Skills in the Biochemistry/Molecular Biology Lab

**Authors:** Boyer, Rodney

## Abstract
Most colleges and universities throughout the world now offer a Biochemistry/Molecular Biology (BMB) lab course that is designed for undergraduate students in the molecular life sciences, chemistry, and related fields. To best serve our students, we must introduce them to the most current concepts, skills, and methods available. Suggestions for teaching a modern BMB lab are given here. (Contains 2 tables and 1 footnote.)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ773070

